From: Sid Jain <sid_26@outlook.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Service deferred checkpoints at WASIX idle query boundaries

The shared embedded-wal-pressure-checkpoint patch owns the pending request.
Service it only outside transactions before the next ReadyForQuery response.

diff --git a/src/backend/tcop/postgres.c b/src/backend/tcop/postgres.c
index 06f64145cc..dc8bf8dfa6 100644
--- a/src/backend/tcop/postgres.c
+++ b/src/backend/tcop/postgres.c
@@ -4398,6 +4401,9 @@ PostgresSendReadyForQueryIfNecessary(void)
 		else
 		{
 			long		stats_timeout;
+#ifdef OLIPHAUNT_WASM_SINGLE_USER
+			OliphauntPerformDeferredCheckpoint();
+#endif
 
 			/*
 			 * Process incoming notifies (including self-notifies), if
